    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Entominid clypeum.</em> A Formigan entomorph cleric of the Astringentum, the theocracy of metal-haters — the dish-like crown atop its head holds a pool of blessed acid it pours out to bless allies or dissolve armour. Its Speed is 25 ft. while the Caustic Pool is filled. Habitat: Any.</p><p><strong>Gear:</strong> Staff.</p><p><em>Source: Heliana's Field Notes X-24 (Loot Tavern)</em></p>",
        "public": ""
